<div class="wrap">
  <div class="page-title">Jorgensen Foundation — Logo Variations</div>
  <p class="page-sub"><strong>Direction 1: molecular node-and-bond cluster.</strong> Eight executions (A–H) of the chosen mark · Midnight #302C2E · wordmark in Cormorant Garamond.<br>Each shows the lockup (light), scalability at 24/48/80px, and inverted on Midnight (the real nav background).</p>
  <span class="temp">Temporary preview — not linked, will be deleted</span>

  <!-- ===== FINAL: D-final + favicon variant ===== -->
  <section class="card final">
    <div class="card-h"><span class="dnum">FINAL · D-final</span><span class="dname">Refined floating-bond molecule (the chosen mark, tuned)</span></div>
    <p class="page-sub" style="margin-top:-1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Equilateral tripod, optically centred · center node r5, outer r4 · bonds stroke 2.4 floating with a ~2.5px gap at both ends · Midnight #302C2E, <code>currentColor</code> so it inverts to cream.</p>
    <div class="lockup"><svg class="sym" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><use href="#sDfinal"/></svg><span class="wordmark">Jorgensen Foundation</span></div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="panel"><span class="panel-label">Scalability (vector)</span><div class="sizes"><div class="szcell"><svg class="sym" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><use href="#sDfinal"/></svg><span class="szlab">24px</span></div><div class="szcell"><svg class="sym" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><use href="#sDfinal"/></svg><span class="szlab">48px</span></div><div class="szcell"><svg class="sym" width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><use href="#sDfinal"/></svg><span class="szlab">80px</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="panel dark"><span class="panel-label">Inverted (nav)</span><div class="lockup"><svg class="sym" width="42" height="42" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><use href="#sDfinal"/></svg><span class="wordmark">Jorgensen Foundation</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel favtest">
      <span class="panel-label">Favicon stress test — SVG rasterised at the real pixel size, then magnified 10× (nearest-neighbour) so you see exactly what survives</span>
      <div class="favgrid">
        <div class="favcell"><canvas data-sym="final" data-size="16" data-mode="light"></canvas><span class="szlab">16px</span></div>
        <div class="favcell"><canvas data-sym="final" data-size="24" data-mode="light"></canvas><span class="szlab">24px</span></div>
