  <section class="card final">
    <div class="card-h"><span class="dnum">FINAL · D-favicon</span><span class="dname">Favicon-optimised cousin — same molecule, thicker bonds + bigger nodes for tiny sizes</span></div>
    <p class="page-sub" style="margin-top:-1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Identical node positions to D-final, but center r5.5 / outer r4.5 and bonds stroke 3.2 with shorter, clearer stubs — so the four dots and the gap still read at 16px where D-final's hairline bonds thin out.</p>
